{"v":4,"catch":"一款相當與眾不同的殭屍遊戲。","desc":"在《我是殭屍》遊戲裡，你是殭屍群的領袖，目標是感染地圖上的所有人類。任何時候你感染一個人類，就可以將他變成你的同類，然後可以利用他來對抗武裝的士兵；你也可以指揮你的殭屍群攻擊敵人、跟隨你或者等候聽令。每一個場景都需要運用戰術並謹慎規劃，才能成功達成目標。","publisher":"Awesome Games","release":"2021-06-24","genres":["益智","策略","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","俄文","韓文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/85025fa3c327239a01c9d79ff9cbc0f7c89846f2548c2edaff4a21f91e406682.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/28e3a862756f114e3e0c8435a676d1bcdb37b41de2e5ee204a130c869b326bba.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0a49b44c5a9846e4e6b40ed25bd75f98fc9440cba2f6f5bf7d9a3ee200db00f2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9cd9b243a28043ee0b3143f7a6bb10b5cb2de0ebaddbffc530a8ff96c7b4cb0e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/884e4d4276e79ecd24ef9e4b172b22065106a49fb4a15f9752c18b7147c75b2f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a83eae6b5de3512e78548ed652235b068784e7951a0f066fd570d2f70ba3a5ee.jpg"],"titleId":"0100429006a06000","dlc":[]}